; perf_air (plan row P253, ADR 0013 section 1): the perf arena's two armies with 16 aircraft among 150 units: 150
; mobile rows (67 ground units and 8 aircraft for each side, 4 Drillhead bombers and 4 Torchjet fighters) and, beside
; them, a Flight Yard and a Burst Stack for each side, all on frozen defs. The rifle and rocket squads and the Burst
; Stack are the air arena's own copies (data/dev/arena/air/), which carry the layer masks, so ground fire at aircraft
; is part of the run. Each side's 8 aircraft share the one 4-pad Flight Yard (more than its pads: a stress choice).
; Only the Derrick League's aircraft are frozen. Orders at ticks 0, 330 and 640 send everyone to the middle, deep into
; the other side and back, so the aircraft fly, bomb and rearm to the end of the run.

